# The api and blazor images build from the repository root, because both
# projects reference BillsMinimalApi.Contracts and a Docker build cannot reach
# outside its own context. That makes the whole repo the build context, so
# everything not needed to compile those two projects is excluded here — most
# importantly the host's bin/obj, which would otherwise be copied over the
# container's own output, and .git, which is the largest thing in the tree.

**/bin/
**/obj/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Screenshots, both the tracked ones and the scratch directory Playwright
# writes to. Neither is compiled into anything.
docs/
.playwright-mcp/

# Integration tests. They run in CI and on a developer machine, never in the
# image being shipped.
tests/

**/*.sln
**/*.user
**/*.http
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
**/*.md
